1. Open CrypTool

2. Caesar Cipher
   ↓
   Symmetric (classic)
   ↓
   Caesar

3. Enter plaintext
   Example:
   HELLO

4. Set shift:
   3

5. Click Encrypt

6. Observe ciphertext:
   KHOOR

7. Click Decrypt

8. Verify:
   HELLO

9. Open Playfair

10. Enter plaintext/key according to
    the CrypTool exercise

11. Encrypt

12. Record ciphertext

13. Decrypt

14. Verify original plaintext

15. Open Vernam

16. Enter plaintext

17. Enter key

18. Encrypt

19. Record ciphertext

20. Decrypt

21. Verify original plaintext
